sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant ST as Streamlit Frontend (:8501)
    participant API as FastAPI Backend (:8000)
    participant LG as LangGraph Agent
    participant Tool as Tool Registry
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    User->>ST: Submits Prompt ("What time is it in Tokyo?")
    ST->>API: POST /agent/chat/stream {prompt, thread_id}
    Note over API: Handshake HTTP 200 OK<br/>Content-Type: text/event-stream
    API-->>ST: HTTP 200 (Stream Open)

    API->>LG: astream_agent_lifecycle(messages, thread_id)
    LG->>LLM: Model.bind_tools().invoke(messages)
    LLM-->>LG: AIMessage(tool_calls=[get_current_time(timezone='Asia/Tokyo')])

    LG-->>API: on_tool_start event
    API-->>ST: event: tool_start\ndata: {"tool": "get_current_time", ...}
    Note over ST: Render st.status("Executing get_current_time...")

    LG->>Tool: get_current_time(timezone="Asia/Tokyo")
    Tool-->>LG: "Current Time in Asia/Tokyo: 2026-10-11 04:17:34 JST"

    LG-->>API: on_tool_end event
    API-->>ST: event: tool_end\ndata: {"output": "2026-10-11 04:17:34 JST"}
    Note over ST: Update st.status to Complete ✅

    LG->>LLM: Model.invoke(messages + ToolMessage)
    LLM-->>LG: Stream token chunks: "The", " time", " in", " Tokyo", " is"...

    loop Token Streaming
        LG-->>API: on_chat_model_stream (chunk)
        API-->>ST: event: token\ndata: {"content": "..."}
        Note over ST: Append chunk to st.chat_message
    end

    LG-->>API: on_chain_end
    API-->>ST: event: done\ndata: {"status": "completed"}
    Note over ST: Finalize message & persist in session_state
